{"title":"2022 SSMO Relay Round 3 Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_SSMO_Relay_Round_3_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/0/ae0734db2c961f41d5627f830ea0e5c1de76262f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f:\\mathbb{Z}\\to\\mathbb{Z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"80\" height=\"18\" /> be a function such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/d/82d0e714dd3855ef2e740b789ae984e1d7cd5f39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(0)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/a/89a5b9594b5af4a2ad26c6a7c0d6447075ca86d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(|x^2-4|)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"119\" height=\"21\" /> whenever <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/c/a8c9cbf3e3c04dc46dea71f60acd0cb704eabc4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"71\" height=\"20\" />. Suppose further that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/4/c24d83651f34ac0c6bf4c1c0f0fdaffcde458028.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|f(x+1)-f(x)|=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"170\" height=\"20\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/e/14e1fc2610d0ab9747b552684df1356df224e62a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\in\\mathbb{Z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"13\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> be the number of possible sequences <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/3/c63ce779c6a2e8d99b0999f097761a71f0ac0e4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{f(1),f(2),\\dots,f(21)\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"180\" height=\"20\" />. Find the remainder when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> is divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/e/6ee927e1332358c96c62c277441c907c4f51057f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_SSMO_Relay_Round_3_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/d/82d0e714dd3855ef2e740b789ae984e1d7cd5f39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(0)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/1/ba19296987469ea2213f976a2ad1a6692250c9bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(|0^2-4|)=f(4)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"176\" height=\"21\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/4/dd45841cc445fcf72997a3ed15cb49ab1346ff86.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(|4^2-4|)=f(12)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"186\" height=\"21\" />. Define <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/6/0361fe6ce57c570480cd18251b06a250af21d380.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\delta_x=f(x+1)-f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"167\" height=\"20\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/a/f5a1e107c9fbbd268ec314a23d154bd43b284609.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\delta_x\\in\\{-1,1\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"99\" height=\"20\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/e/14e1fc2610d0ab9747b552684df1356df224e62a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\in\\mathbb{Z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"13\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/7/2f7a5e56e4c7186a0212cd7916aad130d70506b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(4)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" />, we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/5/7156ffb24e41bb3cbbb8be66c457378838269527.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\delta_1+\\delta_2+\\delta_3+\\delta_4=0,\\]\" width=\"165\" height=\"17\" /> so exactly two of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/a/a3aa48391e46964a7f8cd0ec4f7d72f5b5cf54c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{\\delta_1,\\delta_2,\\delta_3,\\delta_4\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"106\" height=\"20\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> and the other two are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, giving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/9/5c9b68a04fadb4cbe90954c537de424c1519ef51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\binom{4}{2}=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"70\" height=\"53\" /> choices. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/6/376095a3ab85052c9c1d3bd99174ea18f0bdcc26.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(12)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"78\" height=\"20\" />, we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/2/3323165a5589bd58c59ab2add476230aeb1991b9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\delta_5+\\delta_6+\\cdots+\\delta_{12}=0,\\]\" width=\"178\" height=\"17\" /> so exactly four of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/3/4238efd744d12276facdcd0dc47b8955ae197116.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{\\delta_5,\\dots,\\delta_{12}\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"98\" height=\"20\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/e/bae5aba07d37ff6ff813107e76260fb31ad5794e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"25\" height=\"15\" /> and the other four are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, giving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/4/834b6a699d5badd5445f7870cd640be34881925c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\binom{8}{4}=70$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"79\" height=\"53\" /> choices. Finally, each of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/8/69885651a6ff2072d7f922e76f53460711181233.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\delta_{13},\\dots,\\delta_{21}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"87\" height=\"18\" /> can be chosen freely from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/7/5f79a5525c1ced7b0864daf0a93efbaf21d35450.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{-1,1\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"57\" height=\"18\" />, giving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/6/136b5202aeddb8e146da2a7ad56af7b1edd00e7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^9$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> choices. Thus the total number of sequences <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/3/c63ce779c6a2e8d99b0999f097761a71f0ac0e4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{f(1),f(2),\\dots,f(21)\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"180\" height=\"20\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/2/1f2e3efd5cb212a43c3fa2c1b99c2b9d37090b10.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[6\\cdot70\\cdot512\\equiv\\boxed{40}\\pmod{1000}.\\]\" width=\"246\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p>~pinkpig\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018022042\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.014 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.024 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 124/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6041/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:26222:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018022042 and revision id 280192. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}